## Interface: 11507, 16001
## Title: PadKeys - Combat
## Notes: Changes the UI when you enter and leave combat: a short "Combat" / "Out of Combat" text, and out of combat a list of missing or expiring long buffs for your class and group that fades out in combat. Needs PadKeys.
